# Unknown Extraction

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-unknown-extraction.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-unknown-extraction.md)

**Ask:** what important information is missing, uncertain, or requires confirmation?  
**Never:** convert uncertainty into facts · guess · remove unknowns to look complete

## Core

**Do not remove uncertainty. Uncertainty is part of the care reality.**

## Required (engine)

Question · related object · source · importance · status (`open` / `answered` / `declined` / `no_longer_relevant`)

## Caregiver UI

Plain language only — never status enums or engine ids.

Doc examples are illustrations only — never product if-branches.

